      "text": "[7:15AM] \n#LekkiAjahCorridor\n#TrafficUpdate\nGood traffic movement from Ajah  jubilee bridge enroute Northwest, Ikota, Chevron up to Igboefon. \n\nWhile traffic is busy from Igboefon, connecting Jakande, Chisco respectively due to morning rush. \nLeaving Chisco inward Ikate and Marwa is moving fine at this moment.\n\n Return journey from Marwa back to Ajah in good shape. \n#FollowLASTMA",
